        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dorian Gray, Oscar Wilde\n- Works: The Picture of Dorian Gray, Lippincott's Monthly Magazine\n- Roles: main character, editor\n\nFacts:\n- In July 1890, Oscar Wilde's philosophical novel The Picture of Dorian Gray was first published complete in Lippincott's Monthly Magazine.\n- Before that 1890 magazine publication, the editor of Lippincott's Monthly Magazine feared the story was indecent and deleted roughly five hundred words without Oscar Wilde's knowledge.\n- Dorian Gray is the main character of Oscar Wilde's 1890 novel The Picture of Dorian Gray.",
